{
  "kanji": "巻",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 巻\ntitle: roll; book volume\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-6, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 9\nradical: 己\nradicalNumber: 49\nonyomi: [カン, ケン]\nkunyomi: [ま.く, まき, ま.き]\ndistractors: [券, 卵, 差]\n---\n\n# 巻 — roll; book volume\n\n**Strokes:** 9 · **Key (radical):** 己 (no. 49) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n巻 concerns rolling or winding and also a volume of a book. 巻く まく means to wind, coil or roll something; 一巻 いっかん can mean one volume or the first volume. The reading and complete expression distinguish the action from a book volume.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Notice the broad upper strokes over the curled lower component 己; imagine paper being gathered into a roll. This is a modern-shape mnemonic, not a historical explanation.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| カン | on | 一巻 いっかん - one volume; first volume |\n| ケン | on | 席巻 せっけん - sweeping across; overwhelming |\n| ま.く | kun | [巻く](../words/巻く.md) まく - wind; coil; roll |\n| まき | kun | 巻 まき - roll; winding; [寝巻](../words/寝間着.md) ねまき - nightclothes; alternate spelling of 寝間着 |\n| ま.き | kun | 巻き まき - roll; winding; [寝巻き](../words/寝間着.md) ねまき - nightclothes |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [巻く](../words/巻く.md) まく - wind; coil; roll\n- 一巻 いっかん - one volume; first volume\n- 席巻 せっけん - sweeping across; overwhelming\n- [寝巻 / 寝巻き](../words/寝間着.md) ねまき - nightclothes; spellings of 寝間着\n\n## Notes\n\n- 巻 and 巻き are documented spellings of the noun まき. The two source rows do not imply two different pronunciations.\n- 寝巻, 寝巻き and 寝間着 are all ねまき, \"nightclothes\"; the linked article teaches the spelling alternatives together.\n- For a usable volume expression, learn 一巻 いっかん, with a small っ. 席巻 せっけん uses ケン, not カン.\n- Compare [券](券.md), ticket or coupon: its lower shape is 刀 rather than 己.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1161510, 1211140, 1211200, 1360040, 1584060, 1596100.\n",
